// ============================================================================
// rk_widgets.jsfx-inc  --  StepSeq widget remnants: filled rounded rect,
//   slider-wired selection button, hover-hint timer + EON's beveled button.
//
//   Adapted from the widget toolkit of "SEQS (Sequenced FX)" by Joep Vanlier
//   (Saike), distributed under the MIT License:
//
